meta {
  name: 02_UpdateResourceRights
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Scenario: The delegator replaces the rights delegated on a single resource

    Given the delegator has no connection to the receiver
    And the delegator makes the receiver a rightholder
    And the delegator checks which rights on the resource can be delegated
    When the delegator sets read and write on the resource for the receiver
    Then the receiver holds read and write as direct rights
    When the delegator narrows the rights to read
    Then the receiver holds only read
    And a right key the delegator cannot delegate is rejected
    And an unknown resource is rejected
    When the delegator removes the resource delegation
    And the delegator removes the connection to the receiver
}
